WEBVTT

00:17.360 --> 00:20.520
What does it take to be "somebody"?

00:21.600 --> 00:24.800
Fame? Number of views?

00:30.240 --> 00:33.640
As long as someone is still watching,
we're still somebody.

00:37.520 --> 00:42.400
But at what cost, that's to be seen.

00:45.280 --> 00:46.440
I want to die.

02:21.720 --> 02:24.280
Hello! It's JennyX.

02:24.360 --> 02:28.960
I was almost late.
Right now, I've got so much school work.

02:29.040 --> 02:31.040
Plus, the exams are coming.

02:31.120 --> 02:33.120
But I'm afraid that
I will keep you all waiting.

02:33.200 --> 02:36.080
So I think I'll be doing my homework
with everyone.

02:38.920 --> 02:40.560
IF THERE'S NO JANE,
I WON'T PAY ATTENTION TO MY STUDYING!

02:40.640 --> 02:42.600
I WANT TO FUCK YOU.

02:45.280 --> 02:46.680
This one is difficult.

02:46.760 --> 02:49.880
I don't know how to do it.
Could everyone please help me?

02:49.960 --> 02:51.360
I DON'T BELIEVE YOU. YOU CAN DO IT!

02:51.440 --> 02:53.960
Right now, I can't think of anything.
Give me a moment, all right?

02:59.680 --> 03:00.960
IT'S REALLY HARD.

03:05.720 --> 03:09.400
Oh, now I know! This must be the answer!

03:12.480 --> 03:15.040
Oh, I almost couldn't figure it out.

03:15.120 --> 03:18.240
How about you guys?
Have you done your homework?

03:18.320 --> 03:20.680
If you haven't done it,
let's do it together!

03:20.760 --> 03:24.760
I want my channel to be a place
where everyone can help each other.

03:25.400 --> 03:27.960
Or if anyone wants me
to help with anything,

03:28.040 --> 03:30.760
let me know,
and if I can do it, I'll do it.

03:32.320 --> 03:34.720
THE POLICE ARE HELPING SOMEONE
COMMITTING SUICIDE RIGHT NOW!

03:34.800 --> 03:35.800
WHERE?

03:35.880 --> 03:37.200
HERE, WWW.LIVENEWS.COM

03:41.880 --> 03:44.880
Well… so you guys aren't going to
do your homework now?

03:47.440 --> 03:49.680
I'LL ALWAYS BE WITH YOU, JANE.

03:53.160 --> 03:54.680
LET EVERYONE GO AND SUPPORT THE POLICE.

03:56.920 --> 03:59.480
Oh, what's happening?

04:00.040 --> 04:03.320
I'm so worried.
I hope nothing bad happens.

04:05.040 --> 04:06.320
How about this?

04:06.400 --> 04:08.920
Let's encourage
and give our support to the police!

04:09.000 --> 04:11.040
I'll be going too.

04:11.120 --> 04:13.080
I'll be back to do the live stream again.

04:13.160 --> 04:15.120
I'm looking forward to
doing homework with you all.

04:15.920 --> 04:17.480
I'll see you soon.

04:17.560 --> 04:20.160
I'LL BE WAITING. NO MATTER
HOW LATE IT GETS, I'LL BE WAITING.

04:22.200 --> 04:24.160
Why did you have me end
the live stream so soon?

04:24.240 --> 04:25.640
You could've helped boost the views.

04:25.720 --> 04:28.400
It's impossible to get more views.

04:28.480 --> 04:31.000
It's now the number one
trending topic on Twitter.

04:32.520 --> 04:35.040
And will we get the ad fee?

04:35.120 --> 04:37.400
She didn't even say
the name of the product.

04:37.480 --> 04:39.760
We've only gotten half of the money

04:39.840 --> 04:41.160
and if we don't continue--

04:41.240 --> 04:42.760
But I'm sleepy now.

04:43.720 --> 04:46.240
How about this? I'll make you some coffee.

04:46.320 --> 04:48.320
Wait for me, just one sec.

04:48.400 --> 04:50.600
No need. Both of you, get out now.

04:50.680 --> 04:51.520
What?

04:59.240 --> 05:00.320
Greedy.

05:16.040 --> 05:18.400
I finally passed that level.
That swerve was awesome.

05:18.480 --> 05:19.560
-Look, Mon.
-She's here.

05:19.640 --> 05:20.640
Hey Mon!

05:20.720 --> 05:22.000
My goodness.

05:22.080 --> 05:23.480
You're doing good?

05:23.560 --> 05:24.920
Yes, Jane.

05:27.640 --> 05:28.480
Hey!

05:28.560 --> 05:31.160
What did you do?
Why did she say hi to you?

05:31.240 --> 05:34.520
I just complimented her
on her live stream the other day.

05:34.600 --> 05:36.920
Guys, she's got me.

05:37.000 --> 05:38.000
Hey Cake!

05:38.080 --> 05:40.640
How's your wrist? Is it healed?

05:40.720 --> 05:43.360
Oh, it's good now. Thanks.

05:47.320 --> 05:48.520
She remembers!

05:48.600 --> 05:49.800
She remembers me.

05:52.680 --> 05:53.680
Hey Non!

05:54.960 --> 05:56.840
How's your mother?

05:57.440 --> 05:59.640
If there's anything I can do, let me know!

06:00.480 --> 06:01.560
Thanks a lot.

06:04.440 --> 06:05.960
Damn, dude.

06:06.040 --> 06:09.080
Jane remembers things about you!
I'm so jealous now.

06:09.600 --> 06:11.600
-She's here.
-Hello.

06:32.000 --> 06:34.000
Excuse me. That is my seat.

06:39.400 --> 06:41.320
Jane, JennyX, right?

06:42.080 --> 06:45.600
You're in this class? I'm so glad!

06:45.680 --> 06:47.920
I've been your fan
since I was in my old school.

06:48.000 --> 06:51.320
I didn't imagine that when I moved here,
we would be in the same class.

06:51.400 --> 06:53.920
Well, it's nice to meet you!

06:55.080 --> 06:58.000
I'll be waiting. No matter
how late it gets, I'll be waiting.

07:00.520 --> 07:03.320
Oh, are you N?

07:04.240 --> 07:05.520
You remember?

07:06.240 --> 07:10.080
I thought I'd be one of the fans
that wouldn't be recognized.

07:10.640 --> 07:13.560
Well, there's no one
that's not interesting.

07:14.160 --> 07:15.640
Whoa!

07:15.720 --> 07:19.080
Even a short speech is so touching.
You're really JennyX.

07:20.400 --> 07:23.400
Oh, and by the way, is this your seat?

07:24.280 --> 07:25.120
Yes.

07:25.200 --> 07:28.480
Can I sit here? I like this spot so much.

07:28.560 --> 07:31.680
Could you move to the spot
over there instead?

07:33.680 --> 07:36.120
Oh, yes, of course.

07:41.440 --> 07:45.400
With me, if you're not okay,
you can just say that you're not okay.

07:46.360 --> 07:49.800
You don't have to do
what you don't want to do.

07:53.720 --> 07:55.560
I've been your fan for so long.

07:56.120 --> 07:57.840
I've been following your photos
on Instagram every day,

07:57.920 --> 07:59.280
and watching your live streams
all the time.

08:00.640 --> 08:04.120
I can tell that you're not really happy.

08:07.240 --> 08:09.520
Hey, did you misunderstand something?

08:10.360 --> 08:12.880
And one more thing,
I can sit here, it's fine.

08:15.320 --> 08:16.960
You may go back to your own seat.

08:20.400 --> 08:23.400
I know that you
don't really want to sit here.

08:24.280 --> 08:25.400
Right?

08:28.840 --> 08:33.120
With me, you can say
what you're really feeling.

08:35.600 --> 08:38.120
I just don't want you
to feel lonely anymore.

08:43.720 --> 08:45.799
And, this graph shows the half-life.

08:45.880 --> 08:49.480
And in the next question,
we can see the velocity-time graph.

08:51.200 --> 08:54.640
In the velocity-time graph,
this slope equals acceleration.

08:54.720 --> 08:57.640
And this area here is the displacement.

08:59.040 --> 09:01.200
Jane, do you want to sit
and have lunch together with us?

09:02.320 --> 09:04.080
And what are you going to
go live about today,

09:04.160 --> 09:05.080
doing homework or what?

09:05.160 --> 09:06.640
I don't know yet.

09:06.720 --> 09:09.840
I'm so jealous. How does it feel
to have so many followers?

09:09.920 --> 09:12.240
Well, at first, I just thought
that I'd do it for fun.

09:12.320 --> 09:13.920
I didn't think I'd get so many followers.

09:14.000 --> 09:14.840
I see.

09:14.920 --> 09:16.960
And how much do you make
when the product comes in?

09:19.040 --> 09:21.360
That, I don't know.
My parents take care of it.

09:21.440 --> 09:23.080
-I see.
-Jane.

09:23.840 --> 09:26.280
Can you come here?
I have a favor to ask you.

09:26.360 --> 09:28.640
Oh, and bring your meal here.

09:29.840 --> 09:30.760
Excuse me.

09:32.120 --> 09:33.520
Never mind. I got her picture.

09:33.600 --> 09:35.920
Gosh. Jane is so pretty.

09:42.160 --> 09:44.400
So, what do you want me to help you with?

09:45.120 --> 09:46.120
Nothing.

09:46.680 --> 09:49.480
I just saw that
you were quite uncomfortable there.

09:50.040 --> 09:51.760
If it were me, I would be too.

09:52.440 --> 09:55.240
Were they talking to you
or interviewing you?

10:00.760 --> 10:02.040
What are you eating?

10:02.560 --> 10:04.040
Why does it look so bland?

10:04.760 --> 10:07.880
Oh, my mom looks after my diet.

10:08.480 --> 10:10.080
She's afraid that I'll have a bad figure.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.360
Yuck.

10:12.920 --> 10:15.040
It doesn't look tasty at all.

10:16.080 --> 10:17.640
Do you want to eat something like this?

10:21.600 --> 10:24.360
Eat this. It's good.

10:29.120 --> 10:30.000
Are you sure?

10:33.640 --> 10:34.720
Eat up.

10:39.280 --> 10:40.160
Wow.

10:40.880 --> 10:43.440
I haven't had
anything like this for so long.

10:45.200 --> 10:48.600
That's good.
If you like it, take more of it.

10:49.160 --> 10:50.360
There.

10:53.040 --> 10:55.160
It's okay every once in a while, you know.

10:55.240 --> 10:57.880
People should have time
to do what they want

10:58.400 --> 11:00.360
without being worried,

11:02.480 --> 11:04.520
without keeping up their image,

11:04.600 --> 11:08.520
and just feel safe
to be who they really are.

11:10.640 --> 11:14.920
When you're with me,
I'll be that safe time for you.

11:22.240 --> 11:26.960
Hey, the snack that you reviewed,
it's not yummy at all, you know.

11:27.040 --> 11:28.400
Do you think I enjoyed it?

11:28.480 --> 11:32.200
This one, when I had it,
I almost had to run and throw up.

11:32.280 --> 11:34.080
But instead, I had to do this.

11:34.680 --> 11:37.320
Wow, guys, this one is so yummy!

11:42.040 --> 11:44.080
Right! This one too.

11:44.160 --> 11:45.760
I was so badly allergic to this one.

11:45.840 --> 11:47.480
I had to cover it
with foundation for days.

11:48.080 --> 11:52.080
Oh, and your parents, did they not
carefully check the products first?

11:54.320 --> 11:55.600
Mom and Dad?

11:55.680 --> 11:58.640
As long as it's profitable,
they let me do everything.

11:58.720 --> 12:02.480
Jane, someone wants you
to do a review on kitchen supplies.

12:02.560 --> 12:04.240
So we have to cook, all right?

12:04.960 --> 12:07.120
Whatever is profitable,
they have me do it.

12:08.800 --> 12:11.800
They don't care how late it is
or how tired I am.

12:11.880 --> 12:14.160
These masks are really good.

12:14.760 --> 12:16.000
This one, I don't get paid to review.

12:16.080 --> 12:17.840
I'm just telling you that they're good.
I use them myself.

12:17.920 --> 12:20.760
I must lie to other people that
the products are of good quality.

12:20.840 --> 12:24.320
Lucky…

12:24.400 --> 12:28.280
Sadhu.
Wow, we got lots of money this month.

12:29.680 --> 12:33.360
Right, honey. It's almost Jane's birthday.
What should we buy her?

12:36.720 --> 12:38.880
A cell phone?
I heard she wanted a new one.

12:40.480 --> 12:41.840
Let's see…

12:42.640 --> 12:46.240
How about buying more followers?
That way, we'll get more sponsors.

12:46.320 --> 12:48.120
And we can get a higher rate.

12:54.640 --> 12:55.840
That's a good idea.

12:55.920 --> 12:58.160
You take a look how much it should cost.

12:58.640 --> 12:59.760
Screw them.

13:06.400 --> 13:10.480
Being famous
isn't as comfortable as I thought.

13:10.560 --> 13:15.920
My followers want me to be
a good, lively, and caring person.

13:16.000 --> 13:17.040
And those who don't like me

13:17.120 --> 13:19.600
think that they can make
whatever comments they want about me,

13:19.680 --> 13:23.160
because my image is that
I am always kind, understanding,

13:23.240 --> 13:24.800
and ready to forgive everyone.

13:26.240 --> 13:27.600
It makes me sick.

13:31.080 --> 13:34.440
And what exactly do you want to do?

13:35.520 --> 13:38.760
I want… to run away from everything.

13:39.720 --> 13:44.080
I'm sick and tired of being
a lively, caring person.

13:44.800 --> 13:47.280
I'm sick and tired of being
Mom and Dad's merchandise.

13:47.840 --> 13:49.960
I'm sick and tired of being JennyX.

13:50.040 --> 13:53.800
I just want JennyX
to disappear from this world.

13:55.000 --> 13:59.720
Disappear from this world?
Did you really mean that?

14:00.320 --> 14:01.280
Of course.

14:01.880 --> 14:05.240
But I don't think that it's possible.

14:06.640 --> 14:10.320
Actually, there is a solution
to make it possible.

14:10.800 --> 14:13.600
Nanno, do you mean
I should run away from home?

14:15.120 --> 14:19.200
I just hang out for a while outside,
and people recognize me.

14:20.120 --> 14:23.800
And one more thing, Mom and Dad…

14:28.080 --> 14:29.360
gave me this.

14:37.160 --> 14:39.240
I didn't mean running away from home.

14:43.280 --> 14:45.360
I meant escaping from this world.

14:56.120 --> 14:57.440
Is our daughter home yet?

15:02.400 --> 15:03.240
Yes, she is.

15:03.320 --> 15:04.960
All right, that's good.

15:25.440 --> 15:28.080
Hello, everyone! It's Jane!

15:28.160 --> 15:31.040
Today I have a very important thing
to tell you.

15:31.600 --> 15:33.200
About how I really feel.

15:33.280 --> 15:34.960
Hey, our daughter is live early today.

15:35.040 --> 15:37.280
-And what I want to do most in my life.
-Is there anything?

15:37.360 --> 15:38.760
Just for fun, I think.

15:39.600 --> 15:43.400
When you hear about it,
you may think about a "dream," right?

15:43.480 --> 15:45.160
-GETTING EMOTIONAL TODAY.
-I'M ABOUT TO CRY.

15:45.240 --> 15:49.440
But, do you know that
every time I think about my dream…

15:49.920 --> 15:52.280
it becomes empty.

15:54.600 --> 15:57.120
Because in one day,

15:57.640 --> 15:59.880
I don't even have time
to think about myself.

16:01.760 --> 16:05.120
All this time, I had to review
these lame products.

16:06.720 --> 16:08.960
This stuff,
do you think it's good for you?

16:10.720 --> 16:12.880
What is she thinking?

16:14.280 --> 16:15.720
Hey, what are you doing?

16:17.560 --> 16:20.520
Jane, open the door. Jane!

16:20.600 --> 16:21.920
Get the key.

16:22.520 --> 16:24.360
Jane, it's Dad. Open the door.

16:25.080 --> 16:27.000
I have to lie to everyone.

16:27.640 --> 16:29.200
Do you want to know why?

16:29.280 --> 16:30.920
-WHO HURT JANE?
-THAT'S GOOD. EXPOSE THEM!

16:31.000 --> 16:32.480
I'VE NEVER SEEN JANE LIKE THIS BEFORE.

16:32.560 --> 16:35.040
DID ANYONE DO SOMETHING TO YOU?

16:35.120 --> 16:38.800
-JANE, DON'T CRY.
-NO, I FEEL SORRY FOR YOU.

16:38.880 --> 16:41.640
-SAY IT, JANE.
-HANG IN THERE.

16:41.720 --> 16:43.600
SHIT.

16:43.680 --> 16:47.400
Because my mom and dad
don't know how to make money,

16:47.480 --> 16:49.480
so they had to use me
as their money-making tool.

16:50.440 --> 16:51.280
Jane!

16:51.360 --> 16:53.080
-FUCKING CAPITALISM.
-TOXIC PARENTS.

16:53.160 --> 16:55.320
-DISGRACEFUL.
-I FEEL SORRY FOR YOU, JANE.

16:55.400 --> 16:58.520
But I'm sick and tired
of lying to everyone.

16:58.600 --> 16:59.760
ONLY THE FITTEST CAN SURVIVE.

16:59.840 --> 17:01.080
-HEY!
-THERE, A LIAR!

17:01.160 --> 17:04.200
I'm sick and tired of doing things
that I don't want to.

17:04.680 --> 17:06.440
Sick and tired!

17:06.520 --> 17:08.640
-Jane!
-Sick and tired!

17:08.720 --> 17:09.640
Honey.

17:14.119 --> 17:15.000
Jane.

17:18.640 --> 17:22.760
But do you know that
when I didn't want to do anything anymore,

17:23.280 --> 17:25.280
there was one thought popping in my head.

17:25.880 --> 17:27.480
And I knew right away

17:28.119 --> 17:29.200
that I wanted to do it.

17:31.560 --> 17:32.839
JANE'S PARENTS SHOULDN'T DO THAT.

17:32.920 --> 17:34.040
I want to die.

17:34.120 --> 17:35.320
Hello, Police Officer?

17:35.400 --> 17:38.760
My daughter is committing suicide live
right now, but I don't know where she is.

17:38.840 --> 17:41.160
Could you please track her down
from her cell phone's signal?

17:41.680 --> 17:42.920
It's JennyX.

17:43.000 --> 17:43.960
CALM DOWN, JANE.

17:44.040 --> 17:46.040
-JUST SAYING IT TO GET ATTENTION.
-YOU WOULDN'T DARE.

17:46.120 --> 17:48.240
-NO, JANE.
-I DON'T THINK SHE HAS THE GUTS.

17:48.320 --> 17:50.880
-ATTENTION SEEKER.
-CALM DOWN.

17:50.960 --> 17:54.120
So everyone, where should I cut

17:54.200 --> 17:55.720
so I can die the quickest?

17:56.480 --> 17:59.640
On the arm? On the chest?

18:00.880 --> 18:02.400
Or should it be on the neck?

18:04.360 --> 18:06.080
Everyone, please help me choose.

18:07.080 --> 18:08.840
I can't stand this kind of life
any longer.

18:08.920 --> 18:10.560
Officer, please hurry up.

18:10.640 --> 18:11.880
So, let's have it this way?

18:11.960 --> 18:13.120
-GO AHEAD. THE NECK.
-THE NECK IF YOU HAVE THE GUTS.

18:13.200 --> 18:15.880
A "Like" for the arm.
A "Wow" for the chest.

18:15.960 --> 18:17.480
THINK CAREFULLY, JANE.

18:17.560 --> 18:19.920
And "Heart" for the neck.

18:20.000 --> 18:21.160
-DON'T DO IT.
-HEART.

18:22.640 --> 18:25.080
-ARE YOU SERIOUS?
-NECK. ONE-HIT KILL.

18:25.160 --> 18:27.160
-JANE, ARE YOU ALL RIGHT?
-YOU CAN ALWAYS TALK TO ME.

18:27.240 --> 18:30.600
It seems like the "Likes" have
the most number of votes.

18:31.720 --> 18:33.680
But I don't think I will die
from cutting my arm.

18:36.600 --> 18:39.800
I'd like to thank you all
for helping me choose.

18:39.880 --> 18:41.520
I'll miss you.

18:42.840 --> 18:43.960
-JANE, DON'T!
-NO, JANE

18:44.040 --> 18:44.960
FINALLY.

18:45.040 --> 18:45.960
-Jane!
-No!

18:48.640 --> 18:50.080
-Jane!
-Jane!

18:50.160 --> 18:51.720
DON'T, JANE.

18:51.800 --> 18:53.280
-HEY.
-SHE'S FOR REAL.

18:54.200 --> 18:58.520
You only kept fucking asking!
My daughter has just killed herself!

18:59.680 --> 19:02.240
Jane!

19:02.320 --> 19:05.280
Jane, my daughter. Jane!

19:20.560 --> 19:21.880
That's so professional.

19:21.960 --> 19:24.160
Truly a high-quality Internet celebrity.

19:26.040 --> 19:27.080
Here.

19:29.120 --> 19:32.880
Actually, there is a solution
to make it possible.

19:35.200 --> 19:36.160
How?

19:38.240 --> 19:40.240
You just have to die in this world.

19:44.760 --> 19:46.640
Not literally die.

19:47.440 --> 19:50.200
I mean, fake your own death.

19:55.080 --> 19:56.000
Thank you.

20:02.440 --> 20:03.560
Is our daughter home yet?

20:03.640 --> 20:04.840
Yes, she is.

20:16.360 --> 20:17.680
Wow.

20:17.760 --> 20:22.440
Now, your mom and dad
won't know that you're not home.

20:23.880 --> 20:27.360
And once they know,
everything will be done.

20:29.040 --> 20:32.400
These are the tools for faking your death.

20:33.000 --> 20:35.040
Choose whichever you like.

20:50.480 --> 20:51.880
Now, you're free.

20:52.520 --> 20:55.680
So free that you don't have to live with
the name your mom and dad gave you.

20:56.520 --> 20:59.240
From now on,
what do you want to be called?

21:02.160 --> 21:03.560
I think, Rosy.

21:33.080 --> 21:34.040
I'd like to check in.

21:34.640 --> 21:35.760
One moment, please.

21:35.840 --> 21:40.240
Here's the development on
JennyX's live-streamed suicide case.

21:40.320 --> 21:43.360
First, my wife and I
would like to say that

21:43.440 --> 21:47.280
we're sorry for what happened with Jane.

21:47.960 --> 21:50.200
And I'd like to ask everyone

21:50.280 --> 21:54.200
to stop sharing her video to honor her.

21:54.280 --> 21:56.400
Are you asking everyone
to stop sharing the video

21:56.480 --> 21:58.280
because Jane exposed the tied-in products

21:58.360 --> 22:00.240
and that you and your wife
forced her to do it?

22:00.320 --> 22:02.600
You can say whatever you want about us.

22:03.480 --> 22:05.320
But I'd like you to believe that

22:05.400 --> 22:07.240
we really loved our daughter
and always had good intentions for her.

22:08.320 --> 22:09.280
Thank you.

22:10.200 --> 22:13.440
If anyone has seen the girl in this photo

22:13.520 --> 22:16.760
last Friday afternoon
before she went live and killed herself,

22:16.840 --> 22:18.920
wherever it was, please let us know.

22:19.000 --> 22:19.840
Thank you.

22:26.280 --> 22:27.320
Miss.

22:27.400 --> 22:28.440
Yes?

22:32.840 --> 22:34.400
Your hair color is nice.

22:35.600 --> 22:36.800
Thank you.

22:37.920 --> 22:38.840
And…

22:38.920 --> 22:40.160
Yes?

22:44.200 --> 22:45.560
Did it hurt when you got a tattoo?

22:47.800 --> 22:49.760
Oh, no.

22:49.840 --> 22:50.960
But it's itchy.

22:51.040 --> 22:52.160
Right, itchy.

22:54.320 --> 22:55.640
Here you go.

23:08.480 --> 23:11.760
It seems like people talk about JennyX
a lot more than before.

23:12.600 --> 23:14.520
Yes. Unbelievable.

23:15.240 --> 23:18.840
But that's all right.
People will forget about JennyX soon.

23:20.800 --> 23:26.280
Humans, they tend to forget about
old things when the new things come.

23:27.080 --> 23:31.600
And when that time comes,
Rosy will finally be free as a bird.

23:34.760 --> 23:35.600
Right.

23:39.560 --> 23:42.960
I brought you soy milk.

23:43.440 --> 23:45.320
Drink it so you'll get a good sleep.

23:45.840 --> 23:49.600
Oh, thank you.
But I'm allergic to soy milk.

24:25.640 --> 24:27.400
THERE'S ONE UPDATED STORY

24:27.480 --> 24:28.360
LIVE STREAM DECEIT

24:28.440 --> 24:32.120
Suicide location found.
No signs of a body.

24:33.240 --> 24:35.360
Speculated to be a fake suicide!

24:36.120 --> 24:40.440
The tip came from
a tenth-grade student, known as…

24:41.360 --> 24:42.240
Yuri.

24:50.200 --> 24:54.360
And this is the place where we found
everything as shown in JennyX's stream.

24:54.440 --> 24:58.280
Is this going to be a case of deception
by an Internet celebrity? Stay tuned.

24:59.000 --> 25:01.000
Didn't we get rid of all the stuff?

25:01.600 --> 25:03.560
There might be someone

25:04.040 --> 25:05.840
who put everything back.

25:05.920 --> 25:07.960
Let's talk to our lead.

25:08.040 --> 25:11.960
LIVE INTERVIEW OF A CLOSE FRIEND
OF THE INTERNET CELEBRITY

25:12.040 --> 25:14.080
I was very shocked
when I found this place.

25:14.160 --> 25:16.840
I can't believe that
Jane would do something like this.

25:16.920 --> 25:19.880
Actually, I'm pretty close to Jane.

25:19.960 --> 25:21.760
Jane is very kind.

25:21.840 --> 25:23.400
Who the hell is she?

25:23.480 --> 25:25.040
I've never seen her face in my life.

25:25.120 --> 25:28.160
And do you think this is a fake suicide?

25:31.840 --> 25:34.120
I believe that a girl
who's as lively as Jane

25:34.200 --> 25:36.320
isn't capable of doing
something like this.

25:36.400 --> 25:39.160
I think there must be a person
who's behind all this.

25:43.200 --> 25:44.520
For clarification,

25:44.600 --> 25:50.080
I've opened a channel called
"Telling Jane's True Story by Yuri."

25:50.560 --> 25:52.120
Please press like, share, and subscribe,

25:52.200 --> 25:54.360
and let's find out
the truth behind all this with me.

25:54.440 --> 25:55.840
How could this happen?

25:56.760 --> 25:58.720
If it turns out this way, I'll be screwed.

26:00.320 --> 26:03.640
Why are you being quiet now?
You were the one who told me to do this.

26:04.160 --> 26:05.560
So, what should we do next?

26:05.640 --> 26:09.640
Why are you so nervous?
As long as no one recognizes you,

26:10.800 --> 26:12.760
Jane doesn't exist.

26:13.240 --> 26:15.080
Fuck! This is all because of you.

26:22.200 --> 26:23.400
Right now, on my channel,

26:23.480 --> 26:26.160
people are starting to give some clues
in the comment section.

26:26.240 --> 26:28.640
I'd like to be the one
with coverage on this matter.

26:40.200 --> 26:41.920
-THE ROOM IS DIFFERENT.
-YURI HAS KEEN EYES.

26:43.200 --> 26:46.640
Well, we're best friends. That's how
we remember each other's little details.

26:53.640 --> 26:55.040
Can you all see this?

27:00.400 --> 27:04.480
And these must be Jane's footprints
after she left this room.

27:04.560 --> 27:07.080
Jane and I wear the same shoe size.

27:08.800 --> 27:11.520
It's the same size. Can you all see it?

27:11.600 --> 27:14.800
-YURI, YOU CAN DO IT.
-YOU'RE PRETTY AND SMART!

27:14.880 --> 27:17.440
BRAVO, YURI!

27:23.000 --> 27:25.280
I'M IN THE SAME SCHOOL AS JANE.
I'VE NEVER SEEN YURI BEFORE.

27:25.360 --> 27:27.120
ARE YOU REALLY JANE'S FRIEND?

27:27.200 --> 27:28.920
HERE COMES A TROUBLEMAKER

27:29.000 --> 27:30.600
TAKE A LOOK HOW CLOSE THEY ARE.

27:30.680 --> 27:33.000
EVEN THEIR ACTIONS ARE THE SAME.
WHY SO CURIOUS?

27:33.080 --> 27:36.160
WAS IT YOU WHO TRICKED JANE?

27:36.240 --> 27:37.760
That's it for today.

27:37.840 --> 27:40.920
And let's find out the truth
about Jane with me later. Bye-bye.

27:57.160 --> 28:00.440
Nothing is as scary
as the truth, right, Jane?

28:01.280 --> 28:03.520
Or… is it Rosy?

28:04.280 --> 28:06.040
Or… is it Jane?

28:06.120 --> 28:08.160
Who are you? What do you want?

28:08.240 --> 28:11.600
I'm the best detective
who knows all about the truth.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.800
Yuri?

28:14.040 --> 28:16.120
I'm a bad liar?

28:16.640 --> 28:18.680
I guess you'll have to teach me, Jane.

28:21.200 --> 28:22.680
So, what do you want?

28:24.640 --> 28:26.640
You can still change your mind, Jane.

28:27.760 --> 28:29.960
I got a way out of this for you.

28:31.560 --> 28:32.960
Let's meet up, shall we?

29:14.360 --> 29:16.200
I thought you wouldn't come, Jane.

29:17.120 --> 29:19.520
Who's Jane? I'm Rosy.

29:21.800 --> 29:24.800
Oh, that's right. Rosy.

29:25.800 --> 29:29.280
After you changed your name,
what did you do?

29:33.600 --> 29:37.800
"Got your hair done,
got a tattoo, got pierced,

29:38.280 --> 29:39.840
-got new clot--"
-Hey!

29:45.480 --> 29:48.560
I have every photo to expose

29:48.640 --> 29:53.720
how that Jane became this Rosy.

29:55.560 --> 29:56.840
What do you want?

29:57.560 --> 29:58.400
Money?

30:00.480 --> 30:02.040
If not money, then what?

30:03.240 --> 30:04.920
I'm being sincere to you.

30:05.560 --> 30:10.320
Because I know that the one
who's with you, Nanno,

30:10.400 --> 30:11.920
is the one who's dangerous.

30:13.280 --> 30:14.720
You know Nanno?

30:16.000 --> 30:17.920
I know Nanno well.

30:18.880 --> 30:20.480
Take a look at these photos.

30:21.240 --> 30:24.320
Who could've taken them
if it hadn't been Nanno?

30:25.440 --> 30:27.640
I just hacked it
from Nanno's cloud, that's all.

30:32.160 --> 30:36.280
If you don't believe me,
take a peek at Nanno's phone.

30:38.000 --> 30:40.000
But let me tell you this.

30:40.640 --> 30:42.240
The only way out of this…

30:45.120 --> 30:47.040
is to run away from Nanno.

30:48.880 --> 30:52.680
But running away won't be enough.

30:53.320 --> 30:55.920
Because Nanno can always
come back and blame you.

30:56.520 --> 30:58.240
Then what am I supposed to do?

31:02.760 --> 31:07.040
What kind of person doesn't speak anymore?

31:18.080 --> 31:19.120
See?

31:20.160 --> 31:22.120
I'm being sincere with you.

31:38.440 --> 31:39.800
Where have you been?

31:43.480 --> 31:45.400
I went out to get some air.

31:46.440 --> 31:48.520
Living a free life in a room

31:48.600 --> 31:50.520
wasn't as fun as I thought.

31:51.400 --> 31:53.440
Do you want to go back
to being JennyX again?

31:54.480 --> 31:58.400
Have you forgotten that you're now Rosy?

32:01.880 --> 32:03.760
Forget about JennyX.

32:04.600 --> 32:07.280
Wait a little longer. When it gets quiet,

32:07.760 --> 32:10.360
Rosy will get to live the way she wants.

32:13.320 --> 32:16.960
As long as the evidence we made
doesn't get exposed.

32:18.920 --> 32:20.880
If Yuri had all the evidence,

32:22.360 --> 32:24.120
she would've shown it all
to everyone by now.

32:26.720 --> 32:33.240
Do you think there's someone else
that has evidence?

32:35.760 --> 32:37.320
I think…

32:40.440 --> 32:42.240
you're confused now.

32:49.560 --> 32:51.080
Maybe I just miss home.

32:56.320 --> 32:57.480
Home?

32:58.640 --> 33:04.240
Home, where your mom and dad
always milked you.

33:06.760 --> 33:09.720
Jane, you won't have a chance
to go back to your mom and dad anymore.

33:10.560 --> 33:11.760
Are you sure?

33:13.280 --> 33:15.800
Nowadays, I don't see
why I need Mom and Dad.

33:15.880 --> 33:18.000
They always exploit me.

33:18.680 --> 33:21.240
This kind of family,
I don't think I want one.

33:23.160 --> 33:24.640
I'm so sorry…

33:26.400 --> 33:29.360
but I don't think you can go home anymore.

34:27.880 --> 34:32.000
As far as I know, Jane just got close
with a new friend called Nanno.

34:32.480 --> 34:35.199
Who knows? She might be
the cause of all this.

34:35.679 --> 34:37.560
How close are they?

34:39.800 --> 34:44.159
And at the scene,
there was another set of footprints.

34:48.960 --> 34:50.920
You see, there are two sets of footprints.

34:51.000 --> 34:53.480
I think it belongs to Nanno.

34:53.560 --> 34:54.800
More importantly,

34:54.880 --> 34:57.800
someone has informed the police
of a lead on the whereabouts of those two,

34:57.880 --> 34:59.320
about where they're hiding.

34:59.400 --> 35:00.440
What are you doing?

35:03.520 --> 35:04.560
I…

35:06.280 --> 35:09.480
I made the wrong decision.
I don't want to be Rosy anymore.

35:13.200 --> 35:14.560
I've told you before.

35:16.000 --> 35:20.280
Why didn't you think it through
before answering?

35:22.040 --> 35:25.040
Now you don't have a home to go back to.

35:29.600 --> 35:31.240
But actually…

35:33.080 --> 35:34.280
there's a way.

35:40.400 --> 35:41.320
Nanno.

35:50.680 --> 35:54.280
Kill me and do as Yuri said.

35:57.000 --> 36:03.120
Right now, your mom and dad
must be missing you to death.

36:05.160 --> 36:07.960
Their precious daughter
has been missing for days.

36:08.440 --> 36:10.680
They don't know how you're doing.

36:12.320 --> 36:16.000
And the beloved daughter
is no longer having fun.

36:17.520 --> 36:19.520
She wants to go back
to the way she used to live.

36:21.320 --> 36:22.600
You see…

36:24.680 --> 36:26.200
it's the only way out.

36:31.280 --> 36:33.280
If you love lying…

36:37.600 --> 36:38.960
then you have to go further.

37:06.480 --> 37:08.080
I've already killed Nanno.

37:09.160 --> 37:10.920
Nanno is dead.

37:13.280 --> 37:15.240
Focus.

37:15.320 --> 37:16.960
First, destroy some stuff.

37:17.040 --> 37:19.960
Use the knife to cut yourself a bit,
like you were fighting.

37:21.080 --> 37:23.840
Then, put the knife
in Nanno's hand to frame her.

37:24.640 --> 37:27.640
After that, you know what to do.

37:28.160 --> 37:30.080
That's your gift.

38:02.400 --> 38:03.640
Help me! Please, anyone.

38:03.720 --> 38:07.880
Please help me.
I don't know where I am now.

38:10.480 --> 38:11.680
Somebody, please.

38:14.200 --> 38:16.560
Jane, don't worry.
Right now, I'm with you.

38:16.640 --> 38:20.000
Everyone, right now, I've found Jane.
She is safe.

38:21.000 --> 38:22.760
What did she do to you, Jane?

38:22.840 --> 38:25.200
It was torture.

38:25.280 --> 38:27.640
She forced me to do all kinds of stuff.

38:27.720 --> 38:31.160
And this is not the color that I wanted.

38:31.240 --> 38:33.760
This is not what I really wanted.

38:34.520 --> 38:39.560
And she forced me to have sex with her.

38:40.600 --> 38:43.760
But I didn't let her.

38:43.840 --> 38:45.080
Get out.

38:45.160 --> 38:49.280
So when she was about to attack me, I…

38:51.800 --> 38:53.840
It was an accident, everyone.

38:53.920 --> 38:56.320
I… didn't mean to do it.

38:56.400 --> 39:01.200
But if I hadn't,
I wouldn't have gotten out of that place.

39:01.280 --> 39:02.840
FAKE! YOU'RE BUSTED.

39:06.080 --> 39:10.840
FAKE! THE REAL JENNYX HAS RETURNED.

39:15.560 --> 39:19.040
Hello. It's Jane.

39:19.120 --> 39:20.240
Jane is back.

39:51.360 --> 39:52.560
You must be very tired.

39:55.000 --> 39:56.240
Is it good?

40:01.480 --> 40:02.560
Dad. Mom.

40:05.280 --> 40:06.360
Is that you?

40:07.480 --> 40:08.720
You dare come here?

40:11.720 --> 40:14.960
Dad, I'm Jane, your daughter.

40:15.040 --> 40:16.160
Whose daughter?

40:16.240 --> 40:18.680
We have only one daughter,
and she's sitting right here.

40:20.480 --> 40:22.880
Mom, this is Jane.

40:23.360 --> 40:25.760
The one who helped you
sell those products.

40:25.840 --> 40:27.800
You made bland food for me to eat.

40:27.880 --> 40:28.920
Quiet!

40:29.760 --> 40:31.560
Jane has never spoken to us that way.

40:36.320 --> 40:37.840
The food is delicious.

40:41.280 --> 40:42.880
The reason for the diet

40:43.880 --> 40:46.240
is because we know
how allergic she is to some foods.

40:46.320 --> 40:48.880
We don't want to risk anything
happening to her.

40:49.560 --> 40:51.040
The reason we put a GPS tracker on her

40:51.520 --> 40:54.040
is because we're afraid
our daughter would meet a person like you!

40:54.800 --> 40:59.280
The reason we do all of this
is because it's what Jane wants.

40:59.360 --> 41:02.080
Jane used to tell her mom
when she was little.

41:02.880 --> 41:06.440
Ta-da. Dad, Mom,

41:06.520 --> 41:09.040
I want to become famous.

41:09.120 --> 41:12.320
Can you help me, please?

41:15.760 --> 41:19.800
That's why we do everything
in order to make her dream come true,

41:19.880 --> 41:22.880
so our daughter will become famous
just as she wanted.

41:27.120 --> 41:28.720
You lied to our daughter before,

41:29.360 --> 41:31.200
and now, you dare lie to us too?

41:32.840 --> 41:34.240
I'm not lying.

41:34.320 --> 41:37.960
Don't you really remember me?
I'm your daughter.

41:44.840 --> 41:45.760
Remember?

41:48.120 --> 41:50.240
Do you remember what you said?

41:51.480 --> 41:54.920
"Nowadays, I don't see
why I need Mom and Dad."

41:55.520 --> 41:59.320
"They always exploit me."

41:59.400 --> 42:00.560
"This kind of family…"

42:01.240 --> 42:02.640
…I don't think I want one.

42:07.160 --> 42:09.960
If you can't remember
what you did or said,

42:10.640 --> 42:12.560
who would remember you?

42:15.720 --> 42:17.760
You…

42:18.400 --> 42:19.280
Nanno!

42:21.640 --> 42:23.280
-You ruined my life.
-No.

42:23.360 --> 42:25.760
-I killed you. How can you be here?
-Stop!

42:26.880 --> 42:27.880
Go away!

42:36.400 --> 42:37.680
Ruined?

42:39.760 --> 42:42.000
You're the one who ruined your own life.

42:43.880 --> 42:45.320
Don't you remember?

42:46.440 --> 42:48.880
You're the one who killed JennyX.

42:50.360 --> 42:54.240
Jane told us about everything,
about the evil things you did to her.

42:55.880 --> 42:56.960
That's right.

42:57.560 --> 43:02.200
They forced me to do things
I didn't want to do.

43:02.920 --> 43:07.160
And they tried to impersonate me.

43:08.080 --> 43:09.440
I don't know.

43:10.480 --> 43:12.520
They had a team for this.

43:14.680 --> 43:15.520
Right.

43:20.880 --> 43:22.080
Dad.

43:23.720 --> 43:26.000
Where's our live camera?

43:26.920 --> 43:32.920
I want everyone
to see this situation clearer.

43:36.600 --> 43:37.680
There it is.

43:44.600 --> 43:46.800
-SHAME ON YOU! IMPOSTER.
-WHAT THE HELL IS WRONG WITH HER?

43:46.880 --> 43:50.040
-JANE, DON'T LET HER ESCAPE.
-CALL THE POLICE.

43:50.120 --> 43:51.720
MAYBE SHE WANTS TO BE FAMOUS.

43:51.800 --> 43:52.920
MAYBE SHE'S INSANE.

43:53.000 --> 43:55.840
Everyone. It's Jane.

43:56.400 --> 44:01.200
As you can see,
look at what she has done to me.

44:01.960 --> 44:03.920
Everyone, please help me.

44:04.600 --> 44:08.600
Everyone, send me support
by pressing "Love."

44:08.680 --> 44:11.480
And press "Angry" for this imposter.

44:11.560 --> 44:13.880
-WHY DOES SHE HAVE TO DO THIS TO JANE?
-POOR JANE.

44:15.000 --> 44:16.960
Dad. Mom.

44:17.560 --> 44:20.560
It's me, Jane.

44:20.640 --> 44:22.200
Dad, can't you remember me?

44:22.280 --> 44:24.880
It has gone this far,
and you're still shamelessly talking.

44:24.960 --> 44:26.360
Dad.

44:27.560 --> 44:28.560
Dad.

44:31.240 --> 44:33.720
Have we called the police?

44:33.800 --> 44:34.800
Yes, dear.

44:40.080 --> 44:42.120
Dad. Mom.

44:54.320 --> 44:56.480
Let me go.

44:56.560 --> 44:58.080
A word, please.

44:59.240 --> 45:00.520
Can you give a statement?

45:00.600 --> 45:02.840
LIVE OUTSIDE JENNYX'S HOUSE

45:02.920 --> 45:05.720
Everyone, this is Jane.

45:06.320 --> 45:08.160
-Everyone.
-It's me, Jane.

45:08.920 --> 45:10.040
Jane is right here.

45:20.440 --> 45:22.520
So what I did was that wrong, Nanno?

45:26.720 --> 45:28.960
Did you have to go this far?

45:43.840 --> 45:46.240
So what I did was that wrong, Nanno?

45:48.960 --> 45:51.200
Did you have to go this far?

46:08.960 --> 46:10.160
That was harsh.

46:13.280 --> 46:16.400
Yuri. You still have a lot to learn.

46:25.040 --> 46:26.480
It doesn't heal?

46:29.800 --> 46:32.120
You couldn't answer Jane's question,
could you?

46:35.640 --> 46:38.080
Are you starting to have doubts
in what you do?

46:44.160 --> 46:45.640
So now, you're mortal, right?

48:37.680 --> 48:42.680
Subtitle translation by:
Tanada Hantaweewatana
